@startuml system-context
!theme plain
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam actorStyle awesome

title ELMOS System Context — Embedded Linux SDK

actor "Developer" as Dev
actor "CI/CD\nPipeline" as CICD
actor "Package\nManager" as PackageMgr

system "ELMOS SDK" as ELMOS {
    component [CLI\nInterface] as CLI
    component [TUI\nInterface] as TUI
}

system "External\nDependencies" {
    component [GCC\nToolchain] as GCC
    component [Kernel\nRepo] as KernelRepo
    component [BSP\nRegistry] as BSPRegistry
    component [Package\nRepos] as PackageRepos
}

system "Output\nArtifacts" {
    component [Zimage\nBinary] as Zimage
    component [Kernel\nModules] as Modules
    component [Rootfs\nImage] as Rootfs
    component [Boot\nImage] as BootImage
    component [QEMU\nDisk] as QEMUDisk
}

system "Deployment\nTargets" {
    component [Embedded\nLinux Board] as Board
    component [QEMU\nEmulator] as Emulator
    component [Docker\nContainer] as Docker
}

' Developer interactions
Dev --> CLI : commands (kernel build, init, etc)
Dev --> TUI : interactive configuration
CLI --> Modules : builds
CLI --> Rootfs : creates
TUI --> Zimage : configures/builds
CLI --> BootImage : generates

' CICD automation
CICD --> CLI : automated builds
CICD --> Modules : integrates modules

' External dependencies
GCC -.-> CLI : cross-compiler toolchain
KernelRepo -.-> CLI : kernel sources
BSPRegistry -.-> CLI : board definitions
PackageRepos -.-> CLI : package metadata
PackageMgr -.-> PackageRepos : publishes ELMOS

' Output artifacts
Modules --> Rootfs : includes in image
Zimage --> BootImage : combines with bootloader
Rootfs --> Board : deploys
BootImage --> Board : boots
QEMUDisk --> Emulator : boots with disk
Rootfs --> QEMUDisk : creates disk image
Rootfs --> Docker : creates layers

' Deployment targets
Emulator -.-> Board : test/validate before deploy
Board -.-> Dev : feedback
Emulator -.-> Dev : debugging
Docker -.-> CICD : containerized builds

note top of Dev
  Primary user interacting with
  ELMOS for embedded Linux development
end note

note top of ELMOS
  Embedded Linux SDK — Buildroot alternative
  Supports: ARM, ARM64, RISC-V
  Languages: C++23 with no dynamic allocation
end note

note right of GCC
  Cross-compiler for target architecture
  (aarch64, arm, riscv64, etc)
end note

note right of Modules
  Kernel modules (.ko files)
  compiled against target kernel
end note

note bottom of Emulator
  QEMU-based emulation
  for testing without hardware
end note
